    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353670/extras/fccca6da2803319eee54a33e4ee0d134.avif?t=1710126863\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About The Game</h2>Players are divided into two teams. The props are trying to hide for as long as possible without the hunters finding them.<br><br>Currently, there are five maps, each with unique props that can be used.<br>The default match is five minutes long, and props have 15 seconds to hide. Players can always edit time settings before starting the match.<br><br><strong>PROP</strong><br>You can change the physical appearance to props that can be found on the map.<br>Tries to hide for as long as possible.<br>You can always use special abilities to escape from a situation and bring hunters closer, which could make the match more interesting.<br><br><strong>HUNTER</strong><br>Tries to find all props before time runs out.<br>One random player is chosen before the match starts.<br>When a prop is eliminated, it joins the hunters' team.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353670/extras/fccca6da2803319eee54a33e4ee0d134.avif?t=1710126863\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About The Game</h2>Players are divided into two teams. The props are trying to hide for as long as possible without the hunters finding them.<br><br>Currently, there are five maps, each with unique props that can be used.<br>The default match is five minutes long, and props have 15 seconds to hide. Players can always edit time settings before starting the match.<br><br><strong>PROP</strong><br>You can change the physical appearance to props that can be found on the map.<br>Tries to hide for as long as possible.<br>You can always use special abilities to escape from a situation and bring hunters closer, which could make the match more interesting.<br><br><strong>HUNTER</strong><br>Tries to find all props before time runs out.<br>One random player is chosen before the match starts.<br>When a prop is eliminated, it joins the hunters' team.",
